{"ID":"20240118145007-82wnalo","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118145007-82wnalo","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118145007-82wnalo\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118145007-z4e97wr\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122163311-2948mjq\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122163311-2948mjq\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:190,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:190\u0026#125;","title":"350萤火351衣鱼","type":"doc","updated":"20240204151713"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118145007-z4e97wr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118145007-z4e97wr","updated":"20240122163250"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"萤火"}]},{"ID":"20240122163250-h12ohcc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122163250-h12ohcc","updated":"20240122163254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】一名夜光。味辛。微温，无毒。主明目，小儿火疮，伤热气，蛊毒，鬼疰，通神精。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122163254-w7b3uwl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122163254-w7b3uwl","updated":"20240122163257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"衣鱼"}]},{"ID":"20240122163257-m9gjhv5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122163257-m9gjhv5","updated":"20240122163302"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味咸，温，无毒。治妇人疝瘕，小便不利，小儿中风，项强，皆宜摩之。生平泽。一名白鱼。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122163305-3osmk76","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122163305-3osmk76"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【产地】产湖中，即白鲤鱼也。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122163306-c1img6j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122163306-c1img6j"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【性味】甘平无毒。味薄不美，故渔人时而弃之。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122163307-zytcf1s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122163307-zytcf1s"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【主治】去水气愈肿也。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122163309-53w3fzf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122163309-53w3fzf"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【用量】属食物类，无定量。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122163310-ew1knkn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122163310-ew1knkn"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【禁忌】无。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122163302-rhacg60","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122163302-rhacg60"}},{"ID":"20240122163310-7h88382","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122163310-7h88382"}},{"ID":"20240122163311-2948mjq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122163311-2948mjq","updated":"20240204151713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"衣鱼啊，过去真鱼很多，实际上它是白鱼，湖里面淡水湖里面产的白鱼，白鱼呢很粘嗒嗒的不好吃，所以渔夫抓到把它扔了，讲的是这种白鱼。实际上就是白的我们叫白的鲤鱼，诸位知道我们利腹水，我们可以用黑鲤鱼配赤小豆这些东西。但是白鲤鱼呢，就是所谓的白鱼在这里，讲的是这个白鱼，也可以利水能够排水，但是它味道不是很好吃，所以大部分都是被渔夫丢弃的，你知道有黑鲤鱼就可以了，黑鲤鱼会比白鱼来的好。"}]}]}